      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-08-31_WidnesExaminer_art0050" n="art0050">
        <head>NOTES AND NOTIONS.</head>
        <p>NOTES AND NOTIONS.</p>
        <p>We understand that the people of Padgate, especially the male folk, are contemplating building a Club Room for billiards and other social intercourse. It is also suggested that land be acquired to be laid out for bowls, tennis, and croquet. Stockton Heath had better look to its laurels ! 0 _ _ _</p>
        <p>The Government is said to be seriously considering the idea of starting a National Limerick Competition. A six-penny entrance fee would produce about a million a week, and all taxes would then be dispensed with.—" Evening News." The public is indifferent to essays and poetry and every kind of pure literature, though it will sit up all night with a wet towel round its head in a mercenary attempt to coax a "limerick " into the full flower of its idiocy.—" T. P.'s Weekly." * The latest blunders made in examination papers include the following gems : " Who was Charon ?" "Charon was a man who fried soles over the sticks." " Who was Wolsey ?"—" Cigarnet Wolseley was the first soldier who introduced tobacco in to England." " What was the Star Chamber ?" "The Star Chamber was a room decorated with stars. Tortures were carried out in this room—hence the expression' to see stars."</p>
        <p>* * * The Latest local flower show is that promoted by the Recreation Club in connection with Messrs. Monks Hall and Co. Ltd., which waw held in the club's grounds oil Lovely-lane on Saturday. As an experi- ment, the exhibition was a great success and showed what an interest some of the workmen take in the culture of flowers. It was also a proof of the useful- ness of the recreation club which, like several similar organizations of the town, does a great deal to brighten the lives of the toilers by interesting them ia healthy pastimes.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-08-31_WidnesExaminer_art0051" n="art0051">
        <gap reason="ocrQuality" quantity="2" unit="words">
