        <p>WARRINGTON WORKS COMPETITION. • FINAL. WALKER'S BREWERY V. FLETCHER RUSSELL'S.— There was a large attendance at Arpley on Saturday to witness the final tie of this competition. Handsome gold medals and gold centre medals were given for the runners and runners-up respectively. Fortunately the weather was fine and the regulation fifty minutes was played. Scores : WALKER'S. • FLETCHER'S. H. Cook c Craik b John James Burrows c Hol- Burro ws J. Caine b Carter J. Dargan at Berry b W.Carter lbw bNorman 2 Carter J. Darton b Carter 2 J. Johnson b Dargan... 0 W. Norman c John J. Thompson b Dargan 4 Burrows b Carter A. Holland b Carter 0 A. Johnson b Dargan 3 G. Pearson not out 15 E. Ratcliffe run out ... 2 W. Ashton b John G. Ford not out 7 Burrows W. Baird b John Burrows 2 I. Turner at Berry b John Burrows J. Mulloy not out 4 Extras Total (for 9 w kts 86 Total 34</p>
