        <p>• Anthor-s-aVea—erSlnte;dea-Kr publication must in all cases send their names and addresses to the Editor as a guarantee of good faith. Matter intended for publication must •be written on onside only of the paper and sent in, if possible,not ater than Thursday.</p>
